# Evidence spans in this repo are verified by SHA-256 over exact byte ranges of
# fixture text, and tests/test_fixtures.py requires byte-stable deterministic
# rebuilds. Any line-ending translation invalidates every content_sha256 and makes
# the golden fixtures fail on checkout. Disable all EOL conversion: what is on disk
# is what is in the object store, on every platform.
#
# The global core.autocrlf=true on the machine this repo was first committed from
# would otherwise have rewritten LF to CRLF on checkout.
* -text
